    "quotes": [
      {
        "speaker": "Michał Mroczkowski",
        "quote": "Content is basically free to produce now, but knowing what actually converts takes context and hands-on experience. Holo's founders have both, and it's what sets them apart. We already see it in their early traction and are glad to back them.",
        "evidence_refs": [
          {
            "source_id": "FISRC-112be79003c8459f",
            "quote": "\"Content is basically free to produce now, but knowing what actually converts takes context and hands-on experience. Holo's founders have both, and it's what sets them apart. We already see it in their early traction and are glad to back them,\" explains Michał Mroczkowski, partner at Market One Capital.",
            "source_content_hash": "b06b466425628cce",
            "quote_hash": "018d1ea787ba6c5d0085274dc47bd3eae833c4e7c3203ea4b0d2bb55237bdc5a"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Aleksandras Urbanavicius",
        "quote": "Most small business owners we talk to are great at what they do, and almost none of them started a business to do marketing. We think that within a few years a small business will be able to market the way the biggest brands do, with a real plan, constant testing and a clear decision every week about what to do next, and the owner won't have to think about it any more than they think about how their bank processes payments. More than 20,000 businesses already pay for Holo, which tells us owners are ready for that, and this round is about getting them there faster.",
        "evidence_refs": [
          {
            "source_id": "FISRC-1e7e3d8e53cc437b",
            "quote": "\"Most small business owners we talk to are great at what they do, and almost none of them started a business to do marketing. We think that within a few years a small business will be able to market the way the biggest brands do, with a real plan, constant testing and a clear decision every week about what to do next, and the owner won't have to think about it any more than they think about how their bank processes payments. More than 20,000 businesses already pay for Holo, which tells us owners are ready for that, and this round is about getting them there faster,\" says Aleksandras Urbanavicius, co-founder of Holo.",
            "source_content_hash": "554c5b61db955f1c",
            "quote_hash": "c060bfa321d2e3f1b0051f34a91dfb416bac792b169acb9439377d0ffe2d42a5"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Deividas Kovger",
        "quote": "Every business on Holo teaches the platform something about what works, from which email subject lines get opened to which ad formats get the most reach. An owner gets a plan built around their business, and that plan keeps changing based on what actually happened. This round lets us push that further, so more of the work can run on autopilot and the owner only steps in when they want to.",
        "evidence_refs": [
          {
            "source_id": "FISRC-1e7e3d8e53cc437b",
            "quote": "\"Every business on Holo teaches the platform something about what works, from which email subject lines get opened to which ad formats get the most reach. An owner gets a plan built around their business, and that plan keeps changing based on what actually happened. This round lets us push that further, so more of the work can run on autopilot and the owner only steps in when they want to,\" says Deividas Kovger, co-founder of Holo.",
            "source_content_hash": "554c5b61db955f1c",
            "quote_hash": "d8048b7bf4854ab76238d08ab5139f9da3b267c8a3558093ebd87cff0214d55d"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "analysis": {
      "investment_rationale": [],
      "capital_judgment": "本轮资本押注的核心变量是Holo能否将已验证的早期增长转化为可规模化的营销自动驾驶能力。已验证信号包括：在252天内达到$5M ARR，本轮前融资不足€1M，超过20,000家付费企业覆盖100多个国家。这些信号表明产品已获得初步市场验证，但资本判断的证据边界在于：ARR和付费企业数来自公司披露，未经独立审计；营销自动驾驶的自动化程度和留存率尚未披露；本轮资金将用于开发营销自动驾驶、触达更多小企业和扩充维尔纽斯团队，其执行效果有待观察。",
